<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">gc</ansi>

Speak to your guild. <ansi fg="command">gc</ansi> is a shortcut for
<ansi fg="command">guild chat</ansi> — your message is heard only by your fellow
guild members who are online.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">gc <message></ansi>   - Say something to your guild
